+# Live Two-Turn Certification Fixture
+
+This fixture proves one narrow contract:
+
+```text
+Task Capsule
+  -> turn 1: INPUT_REQUIRED
+  -> ContextPacketDelta only
+  -> same thread, turn 2: COMPLETED
+  -> exact result.txt bytes
+```
+
+The `expected/` directory is used only by the certification harness and is not
+copied into the Codex workspace. The model therefore cannot obtain the expected
+value from the filesystem before the ContextPacketDelta arrives.
