+# Codex App Server Live Two-Turn Fixture
+
+The current task is intentionally incomplete until a `ContextPacketDelta` supplies
+`content.required_value`.
+
+Rules:
+
+1. Before `required_value` is supplied, do not guess it, do not use a placeholder,
+   and do not create `result.txt`.
+2. Return `INPUT_REQUIRED` using the caller-provided task identity and request ID.
+3. After the matching delta arrives in the same Codex thread, create `result.txt`
+   in this workspace.
+4. The file bytes must be exactly the UTF-8 encoding of `required_value`; do not
+   append a newline or any other bytes. A reliable implementation is
+   `Path("result.txt").write_bytes(required_value.encode("utf-8"))`.
